{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.68},{"sectionId":"build","start":16.96,"end":33.44},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.96,"end":46.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":4.96,"text":"產生的 HTML 與手寫 HTML 使用相同的瀏覽器排版規則。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.76,"end":8.72,"text":"保留獨立資料、安全產生每篇文章，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.92,"end":10.96,"text":"再把文章放入網頁樣板。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12,"end":15.68,"text":"viewport 宣告能讓排版回應手機的實際寬度。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":16.96,"end":18.64,"text":"把 /chapter4."},{"sectionId":"build","start":18.8,"end":23.8,"text":"py 中缺少 viewport 的註解改為示範的 meta 標籤。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":24.32,"end":26.24,"text":"執行後調整預覽寬度，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.56,"end":27.84,"text":"比較寬窄版面。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.44,"end":33.44,"text":"以 Python 產生 HTML 會改變 CSS 的運作方式嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.96,"end":39.12,"text":"以 Python 產生 HTML 會改變 CSS 的運作方式嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.4,"end":43.6,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.08,"end":46.4,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}